  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While selling immortal materials to Fairy Li Shan, Fang Yuan forces this immortal killer move out of the trade after she already sold him Time Luck Immortal Gu. He had failed to deduce a working pairing of Time Luck with inch of time Gu because his time path attainment was too low; her ready move ends that need.",
      "chapters": [
        815
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_li_shan",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "gu_time_luck",
        "gu_inch_of_time_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She refuses to say where she got it.",
      "chapters": [
        815
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Before Hu Immortal blessed land’s earthly calamity he activates the move on Dong Fang tribe captives inside his aperture: white-gold mist drains them into aged corpses, a light pillar rises through his body, and remnant souls then attack his soul until he kills them at heavy cost and recovers with guts Gu. The soul backlash is the greatest weakness, though surviving it and recovering leaves the soul more refined.",
      "chapters": [
        822
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-cast-and-limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "fac_dong_fang_tribe",
        "gu_guts_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Two standing limits are that remnant-soul backlash forbids soul path methods during the soul battle, and that the move can be used only once a month by the immortal body’s experienced time, which runs faster inside a blessed land than in the outside world. Because of Connect Luck with Ye Fan, Han Li, and Hong Yi, a luck increase splits four ways, so as an immortal he keeps little of the gain while the linked mortals benefit more easily.",
      "chapters": [
        823
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-cast-and-limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_connect_luck",
        "char_ye_fan",
        "char_han_li",
        "char_hong_yi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He tells Tai Bai Yun Sheng he already used the move on him before an earthly calamity, and by then Fang Yuan has modified the killer move with the light of wisdom.",
      "chapters": [
        865
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "modified-casts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before later refinement attempts he still casts it each time with little effect and no suitable Connect Luck targets.",
      "chapters": [
        930
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "modified-casts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The cast he made before one trip may have raised his luck for a time and helped him meet an earth shell snail during that trip.",
      "chapters": [
        932
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "modified-casts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Facing Hei Cheng later, he calls the pre-fight cast inappropriate once he sees Hei Cheng’s condition wreck the plan.",
      "chapters": [
        941
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "modified-casts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_cheng"
      ]
    }
